<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mangraisat</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Mangrai law code</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Mangraisat is a law code of Lan Na attributed to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mangrai">Mangrai</a>, founder of Chiang Mai, though it survives only in later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manuscript">manuscripts</a> and how much dates from his reign is uncertain. It regulates matters such as land, irrigation, debt, marriage, theft and fines for injuries, and is a rare source for customary law in a Tai state.</p></div>
